{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43180","headline":"咏浮沤爲辛明府作 · 郑缙","name":"咏浮沤爲辛明府作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行潦散轻沤，清规吐未收。\n雨来波际合，风起浪中浮。\n晶晃明苔砌，参差绕芥舟。\n影疑星泛晓，光似露涵秋。\n皎皎珠同净，漂漂梗共流。\n洁容无变染，圆知有谦柔。\n欲作微涓效，先从淡水游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑缙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}